*.egg-info/

# Model weights.
# The neural checkpoints are small (1-2 MB) and ARE committed: unlike the tree
# models they are not verified bit-reproducible from the seed, so shipping the
# weights is the only way to guarantee the exact model.
# The tree models are not committed -- an unpruned 300-tree forest is ~90 MB
# even compressed, past GitHub's 50 MB warning threshold. They retrain
# bit-identically from the seed in minutes; see README section 7.
outputs/models/*.joblib
outputs/models/*.pkl
# Superseded 10-epoch U-Net checkpoint, kept locally for the epoch comparison
outputs/models/dl10ep_model.pt

